{"seq":2,"slug":"context-mapping","title":"上下文映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/strategic-design/context-mapping","wordCount":1099,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"上下文映射\">上下文映射</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>上下文映射（Context Mapping）描述了不同限界上下文之间的关系和集成方式。如果说限界上下文定义了&quot;边界在哪里&quot;，那么上下文映射回答的是&quot;边界之间如何协作&quot;。</p>\n<p>在真实系统中，没有任何一个限界上下文是完全孤立的。订单上下文需要从商品目录获取价格，支付上下文需要从订单上下文获取金额，物流上下文需要从订单上下文获取收货地址。这些跨上下文的交互构成了系统的集成拓扑。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[商品目录上下文] --&gt;|上游供应| B[订单上下文]&#10;    B --&gt;|上游供应| C[支付上下文]&#10;    B --&gt;|上游供应| D[物流上下文]&#10;    E[用户身份上下文] --&gt;|共享内核| A&#10;    E --&gt;|共享内核| B&#10;    F[外部支付网关] -.-&gt;|防腐层| C\">graph TB\n    A[商品目录上下文] --&gt;|上游供应| B[订单上下文]\n    B --&gt;|上游供应| C[支付上下文]\n    B --&gt;|上游供应| D[物流上下文]\n    E[用户身份上下文] --&gt;|共享内核| A\n    E --&gt;|共享内核| B\n    F[外部支付网关] -.-&gt;|防腐层| C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>映射模式</th>\n<th>耦合度</th>\n<th>自治度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>共享内核</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>紧密协作的团队，模型高度重叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户-供应商</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>上下游明确，上游愿意配合下游需求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>遵奉者</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>下游被迫适应上游模型，无话语权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>防腐层</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>隔离外部系统或遗留系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开放主机服务</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>上游提供标准化协议供多下游消费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布语言</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>通过通用数据格式集成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>各行其道</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>上下文间无集成需求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"共享内核模式\">共享内核模式</h2><p>共享内核（Shared Kernel）是耦合度最高的映射模式。两个上下文共享一小部分模型代码，任何变更都需双方协商一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// shared-kernel/user-identity.ts&#10;// 由用户身份上下文和订单上下文共同维护&#10;interface UserId {&#10;  readonly value: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface UserBasicInfo {&#10;  readonly id: UserId;&#10;  readonly displayName: string;&#10;  readonly email: Email;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 变更规则：&#10;// 1. 任何对共享内核的修改必须双方团队 Code Review&#10;// 2. 共享内核应尽可能小，只包含真正需要共享的类型&#10;// 3. 使用语义化版本控制共享内核的变更\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// shared-kernel/user-identity.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 由用户身份上下文和订单上下文共同维护</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserBasicInfo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserId</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> displayName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 变更规则：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 1. 任何对共享内核的修改必须双方团队 Code Review</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2. 共享内核应尽可能小，只包含真正需要共享的类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 3. 使用语义化版本控制共享内核的变更</span></span></code></pre></div><p>共享内核适用于两个团队紧密协作、沟通成本低的场景。如果团队之间沟通不畅，共享内核会迅速变成耦合地狱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 共享内核&#10;        SK[UserId&lt;br/&gt;UserBasicInfo&lt;br/&gt;Money]&#10;    end&#10;    A[订单上下文] --&gt; SK&#10;    B[用户身份上下文] --&gt; SK&#10;    SK --&gt; A&#10;    SK --&gt; B\">graph LR\n    subgraph 共享内核\n        SK[UserId&lt;br/&gt;UserBasicInfo&lt;br/&gt;Money]\n    end\n    A[订单上下文] --&gt; SK\n    B[用户身份上下文] --&gt; SK\n    SK --&gt; A\n    SK --&gt; B</pre><p><strong>关键约束</strong>：共享内核的大小应该不超过各上下文模型的 10%。如果共享部分持续增长，说明两个上下文可能应该合并为一个。</p>\n<h2 id=\"客户-供应商与遵奉者模式\">客户-供应商与遵奉者模式</h2><p>客户-供应商（Customer-Supplier）是最常见的上下游关系。上游团队是&quot;供应商&quot;，下游团队是&quot;客户&quot;。双方协商接口，上游需要考虑下游的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 上游：订单上下文提供订单状态查询接口&#10;// 供应商承诺的契约&#10;interface OrderStatusService {&#10;  getOrderStatus(orderId: string): Promise&lt;OrderStatusDTO&gt;;&#10;  subscribeToStatusChange(orderId: string, callback: StatusChangeHandler): Subscription;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface OrderStatusDTO {&#10;  orderId: string;&#10;  status: &#39;pending&#39; | &#39;confirmed&#39; | &#39;shipped&#39; | &#39;delivered&#39;;&#10;  updatedAt: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 下游：物流上下文消费订单状态&#10;// 客户可以要求供应商提供所需的接口形式&#10;class ShippingService {&#10;  constructor(private readonly orderService: OrderStatusService) {}&#10;&#10;  async schedulePickup(orderId: string): Promise&lt;PickupSchedule&gt; {&#10;    const status = await this.orderService.getOrderStatus(orderId);&#10;    if (status.status !== &#39;confirmed&#39;) {&#10;      throw new DomainError(&#39;Order not ready for shipping&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;    return this.createPickupSchedule(orderId);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private createPickupSchedule(orderId: string): PickupSchedule {&#10;    return { orderId, scheduledAt: new Date(), carrier: &#39;default&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 上游：订单上下文提供订单状态查询接口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 供应商承诺的契约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderStatusService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getOrderStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">OrderStatusDTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  subscribeToStatusChange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">callback</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StatusChangeHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Subscription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderStatusDTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  orderId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'confirmed'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'delivered'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  updatedAt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 下游：物流上下文消费订单状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 客户可以要求供应商提供所需的接口形式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ShippingService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> orderService</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderStatusService</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  asyn